    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743430/extras/1cb8232c4d883166c8ed2b21e1fc857a.avif?t=1748943138\" width=600 height=230 /></span>Immerse yourself in a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure\u2014a narrative-driven, point-and-click experience that challenges your observation skills, logic and your wits. As you progress, you\u2019ll search richly detailed locations for cleverly concealed objects and tackle a variety of engaging mini-games and puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a realm of mystery where every ripple carries a secret. Velimir\u2014an outcast hunter, desperate to prove his worth\u2014embarks on a mission to find Malena, a young girl who vanished near the eerie shores of the Lake of Tears. Rumors speak of mermaids with lifeless eyes lurking in the depths, but an even older, deadlier power waits below. Venture into a world of ancient magic and hidden creatures as the hunt begins\u2026 and discover whether you are the predator or the prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an exciting variety of puzzles, riddles, and mini-games. From classic hidden object hunts to inventive brain teasers, each challenge tests your sharpness of mind and powers of observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Search for Hidden Objects in everything from misty village shores to the watery ruins that lie below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Solve ingenious mini-games and contend with the elusive Lord of the Lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Collect relics, enchanted trinkets, and powerful items hidden throughout the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Unlock achievements that mark your triumphs and bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Savor an evocative soundtrack and atmospheric sound design that heightens the mystery lurking beneath the water\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your quest in Hunter\u2019s Journey: Tears of the Lake\u2014the depths are calling, and only the bravest will uncover the secret that waits below. Will you prove yourself worthy of the title \u201chunter\u201d?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743430/extras/1cb8232c4d883166c8ed2b21e1fc857a.avif?t=1748943138\" width=600 height=230 /></span>Immerse yourself in a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure\u2014a narrative-driven, point-and-click experience that challenges your observation skills, logic and your wits. As you progress, you\u2019ll search richly detailed locations for cleverly concealed objects and tackle a variety of engaging mini-games and puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a realm of mystery where every ripple carries a secret. Velimir\u2014an outcast hunter, desperate to prove his worth\u2014embarks on a mission to find Malena, a young girl who vanished near the eerie shores of the Lake of Tears. Rumors speak of mermaids with lifeless eyes lurking in the depths, but an even older, deadlier power waits below. Venture into a world of ancient magic and hidden creatures as the hunt begins\u2026 and discover whether you are the predator or the prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an exciting variety of puzzles, riddles, and mini-games. From classic hidden object hunts to inventive brain teasers, each challenge tests your sharpness of mind and powers of observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Search for Hidden Objects in everything from misty village shores to the watery ruins that lie below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Solve ingenious mini-games and contend with the elusive Lord of the Lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Collect relics, enchanted trinkets, and powerful items hidden throughout the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Unlock achievements that mark your triumphs and bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Savor an evocative soundtrack and atmospheric sound design that heightens the mystery lurking beneath the water\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your quest in Hunter\u2019s Journey: Tears of the Lake\u2014the depths are calling, and only the bravest will uncover the secret that waits below. Will you prove yourself worthy of the title \u201chunter\u201d?</p>",
    "short_description": "Descend into watery depths, unravel haunting secrets, and prove your worth as a legendary hunter. Danger lurks beneath every ripple!",
